{
  "$comment": "Where harnesses read a PROJECT's agent workspace from, beyond SKILL.md and agent .md: data, never code. kind: instructions (loaded into every session), command (a slash/prompt command), settings (permissions, hooks, MCP, env), mcp (MCP server config), hooks (hook config), manifest (plugin/extension manifest that wires the rest), code (executed by the harness). Patterns are POSIX globs relative to the scanned root; ** spans directories. Plugin manifests may point at more hook, MCP and code files — those are followed. Verified against the vendors' docs on verifiedAt; re-verify with the model catalogs.",
  "verifiedAt": "2026-11-15",
